    "detailed_description": "[background]<br><br>This is a journey without return<br><br><br><br>When you wake up... In the strange space, the bronze gate that eats people, the strange rules of the game, and the ever-changing nightmare world appear in front of you;<br><br><br><br>You will shuttle among them and become a participant in every story. Life and death, love and hate, and each other's fetters seem to have been engraved in the fate;<br><br><br><br>When you go through the waves, go through one world after another, and open the door to freedom, you will find that all this is just a corner of reincarnation<br><br><br><br>Everything is going on<br><br><br><br>[game features]<br><br>0. Sign a contract, life and death are determined by fate<br><br>1. Infinite flow (shuttle through multiple worlds)<br><br>2. Multi career choice<br><br>3. My wife is very beautiful, and my cat is very cute<br><br>4. The equipment system is featured and elaborately made<br><br>5. The monster challenge is very unique. One of the powerful monsters will kill you<br><br>6. There should be a lot more, but I forgot (meow is the first in the world)",
